<title>MEXICO: Bell Atlantic denies changes at Iusacell.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic denies changes at Iusacell.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Atlantic Corp, which took over management control of Grupo Iusacell SA in February, denied Tuesday it had made changes at the top of the Mexican telephone company.</p>
<p>&quot;There are no management changes in Iusacell,&quot; Steve Fleischer, the U.S. company's spokesman said.</p>
<p>Mexican daily Reforma reported in Tuesday editions that from June 10 there would be changes in the chairmanship of Iusacell.</p>
<p>((--Cyntia Barrera, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9549))</p>
</text>
